style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Blue Sky</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Angel Love</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Nước ép trái cây:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Nước ép táo, ép bưởi, ép chanh dây, ép thơm, ép cà rốt, ép cà chua, ép cóc, ép ổi...</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Nước ép kết hợp</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Nước ép nước ép đặc biệt.</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Nước ép nhiều tầng</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cam vắt, chanh đá...</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Sinh tố Việt Nam:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố bơ, sapoche (hồng xiêm), dâu, mãng cầu, sầu riêng, chuối, mít, khoai môn;</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố dừa, cà chua, dưa gang;</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố chanh tuyết;</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố thập cẩm;</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố hai tầng;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Sinh tố ba tầng.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Trái cây dầm:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm nhóm chua;</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm nhóm ngọt;</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm nhóm béo;</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm đa màu;</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm kem sữa;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm thạch dừa sữa;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Trái cây dầm Italia.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Cacao:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao sữa nóng;</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao sữa đá;</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao bánh sữa;</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao kem sữa;</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao bánh kem sữa;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cacao cocktail;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Mixed chocolate cacao cream;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Mixed coffee cacao cream.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Cafe:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cafe phin đá/sữa;</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cafe bạc xỉu;</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Mixed coffee cream;</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cafe cocktail.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#0000ff;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Kem:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Kem tươi;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Kem ly;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Kem cuộn;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Kem xếp lớp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Kem tự làm.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;color:#0000ff;&#34;>Dạy học cách quản lý quán trà sữa cafe:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Quản lý kế hoạch hoạt động: Cách viết kế hoạch dự thảo kinh doanh của quán.</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Quản lý nhân sự: kỹ năng quản lý nhân sự, kỹ năng phân nhóm công việc, kỹ năng giữ nhân viên giỏi;</span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Quản lý bán hàng: Kỹ năng quản lý bán hàng, thu chi;</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Quản lý nguyên liệu: Kỹ năng chọn mua sản phẩm, bảo quản sản phẩm.</span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;color:#0000ff;&#34;>Dạy học cách marketing quán trà sữa cafe:</span></p>\n<ul><li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Chiến lược để ngày khai trương đông khách.</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Cách tạo dựng thương hiệu ban đầu.</span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Chiến lược phát triển thương hiệu.</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Chiến lược giữ khách quen.</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Chiến lược tìm kiếm khách mới.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Chương trình hoàn thiện chủ quán được thực tập miễn phí tại các quán đông khách nâng cao tay nghề, bước đầu hình thành cơ sở cách mở quán đi bằng thực tiễn thành công từ thực tiễn. Hỗ trợ bước đầu tìm kiếm mặt bằng, tư vấn mặt bằng, mua sắm vật dụng và nguyên liệu để mở quán hoàn thiện.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><a title=&#34;khoa hoc pha che tra sua ngon&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-tra-sua-tran-chau-tra-thai-34.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/link-day-pha-che-tra-sua_4.png&#34; alt=&#34;lam tra sua&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;>  </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop pha che cafe chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-cafe-take-away-smoothies-bartender-37.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-hoc-cafe.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop pha che cafe&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a>   </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop hoc lam kem ngon chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-hoc-cach-lam-kem-ngon-63.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/day-lam-kem.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop lam kem ngon&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:justify;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;, times;font-size:14pt;&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-thuc-an-vat_1.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop che bien an vat ngon tuyet dinh&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></span></p>','Cách làm trà sữa ngon, chuyên dạy làm trà sữa ngon tại nhà trà sữa nhà làm thơm ngon tự nhiên bổ dưỡng','cach pha tra sua, cach lam tra sua, cach lam tra sua tran chau, cach pha che tra sua, cach pha che tra sua tran chau, cong thuc lam tra sua ngon, cong thuc pha che tra sua ngon, cach lam cac loai tra sua, cach lam tran chau, cach lam tra sua thai lan, cach nau tra sua, tra sua nha lam, cach lam tra sua ngon, cach tu lam tra sua an toan, huong dan lam tra sua, huong dan pha che tra sua, huong dan pha tra sua','img_20150823_163640.jpg','img_20150823_163640_1.jpg',1453304566,1475658271,3514,'',29),(67,'','',24,'Cách pha chế trà sữa trân châu ngon','<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><strong>Cách pha chế trà sữa trân châu ngon</strong></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;>Trường đào tạo pha chế trà sữa <span style=&#34;color:#ff0000;&#34;>PASSION LINK </span>xin chỉ dẫn sơ lược về cách pha chế trà sữa trân châu ngon để uống tại nhà.</p>\n<ol style=&#34;list-style-type:upper-roman;&#34;><li><strong>Nguyên liệu:</strong>Trân châu: 200gr</li>\n</ol><p>Trà oolong: 10gr</p>\n<p>Sữa đặc: 2 muỗng canh</p>\n<p>Sữa tươi: 50ml</p>\n<p>Đường: 30ml</p>\n<p>Nước: 80ml</p>\n<p>Vani: 1/4 ống</p>\n<p><strong>II.Cách pha chế:</strong></p>\n<p>Nấu trân châu cho chín mềm rồi cho vào ly.</p>\n<p>Đun sôi nước ủ trà oolong cho ra trà, sau đó lấy nước trà cho vào sữa đặc và sữa tươi đường và vani cho vào ly cho đá vào<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p>Có ngay một ly trà sữa thơm ngon.</p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><strong>Để làm thêm được nhiều loại trà sữa ngon hấp dẫn</strong></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;khoa hoc pha che tra sua ngon&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-tra-sua-tran-chau-tra-thai-34.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/link-day-pha-che-tra-sua_4.png&#34; alt=&#34;lam tra sua&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;>   </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop pha che cafe chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-cafe-take-away-smoothies-bartender-37.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-hoc-cafe.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop pha che cafe&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;>  </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop hoc lam kem ngon chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-hoc-cach-lam-kem-ngon-63.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/day-lam-kem.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop lam kem ngon&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img style=&#34;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;&#34; src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-thuc-an-vat_1.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop che bien an vat ngon tuyet dinh&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></p>','Cách pha chế trà sữa trân châu ngon, cách làm các loại trà sữa ngon tự làm tại nhà PASSION LINK','cach pha che tra sua tran chau ngon, cach lam tra sua ngon','cach-pha-che-tra-sua-ngon.jpg','',1453431833,1457177363,1471,'',30),(68,'','',31,'Cách pha trà sữa','<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><strong>Cách pha chế trà sữa</strong></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;>Trường đào tạo pha chế trà sữa <span style=&#34;color:#ff0000;&#34;>PASSION LINK </span>xin chỉ dẫn sơ lược về cách pha chế trà sữa trân châu ngon để uống tại nhà.</p>\n<ol style=&#34;list-style-type:upper-roman;&#34;><li><strong>Nguyên liệu:</strong>Trân châu: 200gr</li>\n</ol><p>Trà oolong: 10gr</p>\n<p>Sữa đặc: 2 muỗng canh</p>\n<p>Sữa tươi: 50ml</p>\n<p>Đường: 30ml</p>\n<p>Nước: 80ml</p>\n<p>Vani: 1/4 ống</p>\n<p><strong>II.Cách pha chế:</strong></p>\n<p>Nấu trân châu cho chín mềm rồi cho vào ly.</p>\n<p>Đun sôi nước ủ trà oolong cho ra trà, sau đó lấy nước trà cho vào sữa đặc và sữa tươi đường và vani cho vào ly cho đá vào<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p>Có ngay một ly trà sữa thơm ngon.</p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><strong>Để làm thêm được nhiều loại trà sữa ngon hấp dẫn</strong></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;khoa hoc pha che tra sua ngon&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-tra-sua-tran-chau-tra-thai-34.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/link-day-pha-che-tra-sua_4.png&#34; alt=&#34;lam tra sua&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;>   </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop pha che cafe chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-pha-che-cafe-take-away-smoothies-bartender-37.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-hoc-cafe.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop pha che cafe&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a> </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;>  </p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><a title=&#34;lop hoc lam kem ngon chuyen nghiep&#34; href=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/cac-khoa-hoc-day-pha-che/day-hoc-cach-lam-kem-ngon-63.html&#34;><img src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/day-lam-kem.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop lam kem ngon&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img style=&#34;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;&#34; src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/lop-thuc-an-vat_1.png&#34; alt=&#34;lop che bien an vat ngon tuyet dinh&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34; height=&#34;50&#34; /></p>','Cách pha trà sữa ngon, hướng dẫn pha chế trà sữa ngon, 0987013502','cach pha tra sua, huong dan cach pha tra sua','fb_img_1449046669239.jpg','fb_img_1445954304939.jpg',1453447823,1457177347,566,'',2),(69,'','',24,'Dạy pha chế trà sữa ngon để mở quán &amp; Hoc cách làm chủ quán trà sữa - cafe - sinh tố - kem','<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;><strong><span style=&#34;color:#008000;&#34;>TRƯỜNG DẠY NGHỀ <span style=&#34;color:#ff0000;&#34;>PASSION LINK</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>CHUYÊN ĐÀO TẠO PHA CHẾ LÀM CHỦ MỞ QUÁN KINH DOANH TRÀ SỮA, CAFE, KEM, SINH TỐ</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;> CHUYÊN NGHIỆP NHẤT</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>YÊN TÂM MỞ QUÁN KINH DOANH HIỆU QUẢ</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>TỰ TIN CHẤT LƯỢNG ĐỒ UỐNG NGON - DẠY HỌC TÂN TÂM UY TÍNH NHẤT</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:16px;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#ff0000;&#34;>      <span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;>Dạy học cách pha chế làm chủ quán trà sữa - cafe - sinh tố - kem</span></span><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;>, <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>mở quán cafe - trà sữa tự làm chủ tự kinh doanh đang trở thành một ngành nghề kinh doanh đang được chú ý hiện nay. Với vốn đầu tư ban đầu thấp thời gian lấy lại vốn nhanh nếu kinh doanh thuận lợi, ngày càng nhiều chủ quán ra đời.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>Để thành công bạn cần am hiểu về cách thức kinh doanh, cách điều hành quản lý, các chi phí phát sinh trong quá trình kinh doanh, biết được cách pha chế trà sữa, cafe, sinh tố, kem ngon và cách phát triển mô hình kinh doanh để đạt được sự thành công như các quán cafe cao cấp Highland, Trung Nguyên, Starbuck...; cách làm nên thương hiệu cafe take away như milano, passio,...; các thương hiệu trà sữa nổi tiếng như Phúc Long, Hot And Cold, Hoa Hướng Dương, Tiên Hưởng, Gong Cha,...</span>.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><iframe style=&#34;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;&#34; src=&#34;//www.youtube.com/embed/GeROQHr7Mxo&#34; width=&#34;688&#34; height=&#34;372&#34;></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><em><span style=&#34;color:#008000;font-size:10pt;&#34;>Video lớp học pha chế</span></em></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#008000;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:16px;&#34;><img style=&#34;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;&#34; src=&#34;http://phache.com.vn/upload/image/tra-sua-cafe-avatar-q7.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; width=&#34;720&#34; height=&#34;479&#34; /></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:10pt;&#34;><em><span style=&#34;color:#008000;&#34;>Avatar tea &amp; coffee một quán trà sữa và cafe cao cấp ở Quận 7</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> I. Chương trình học khóa</span> <span style=&#34;color:#ff0000;&#34;>dạy học cách pha chế ngon làm chủ quán trà sữa - cafe - sinh tố - kem:</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                           <strong>1) Dạy học cách pha chế ngon:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                    <span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>- Tea (Trà):</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Hot/cold tea ( trà nóng hoặc trà uống với đá): trà gừng, trà mơ, trà đào, trà tắc, trà                                                          chanh, trà thảo mộc.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + World tea ( trà thế giới): trà Thái, trà Ấn Độ, Trà Nhật, Trà Đạo....</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                    <span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>- Milk Tea (Trà sữa)</span></span><span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>:</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                             <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> + Taiwan Milk Tea ( trà sữa Đài Loan): đầy đủ từ cơ bản đến nâng cao các dòng trà                                                          sữa. Các công thức sáng tạo trà sữa cho quán mới.</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thailand Milk Tea ( trà sữa Thái Lan).</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Japan Tea ( Trà sữa Nhật Bản).</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                    <span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>- Jelly and Flan ( thạch và bánh Flan trong trà sữa)</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>                                              <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>+ Jelly in Milk Tea: Các loại thạch trong trà sữa ngon như thạch trái cây các loại như:                                                      thạch dâu, thạch nha đam (lô hội), thạch chanh dây, thạch cafe, thạch trà xanh, </span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                                 thạch khoai môn, thạch táo, thạch kiwi, thạch yogurt, thạch phúc bồn tử, thạch socola,</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                                 thạch việt quất, thạch vỏ cam...</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Jelly self-made: Các loại thạch tự làm, thạch nhà làm, cách làm thạch nhà làm ngon.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Flan self-made: Các loại bánh Flan tự làm.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Flan made from powder: Cách làm Flan từ bột.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch phô mát;</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch khúc bạch;</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch củ năng;</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch củ môn;</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch bắp;</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thạch trứng, thạch bi....</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Thủy tinh các loại</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;>                                              + Các loại hạt đặc biệt: 3Q và Agar.</span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                   <span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;> - Ice blended Cream ( Đá xay kem)</span></span><span style=&#34;color:#000080;&#34;>:</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Coffee Ice Blended</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Coffee Caramel Blended</span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Coffee Hazenut Blended</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Mocha Blended</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Coffee Passion Link Blended</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Ice Blended</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Mint Blended</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Caramel Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Hazenut Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Coffee Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Chocolate Cookies Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Ice Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Hazenut Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Caramel Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Strawberry Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Rasperry Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Blueberry Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Cookies Mint Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;font-size:14pt;&#34;> </span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;> <span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;>                                             + Vanila Blended</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=&#34;text-align:left;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;font-size:14pt;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#34;><span style=&#34;color:#000000;&#